clause.text:
for a separating wall or floor assembly with lightweight wood
                    or steel framing, the index shall be taken as equal to the sound transmission
                    loss, without correction;

for H/D < 1.0,


                                                        Cp

                                                        = –1.0 for x ≤ H, and = –0.5 for x > H.

“seismically isolated structure” includes the upper portion
                    of the structure above the isolation system, the isolation system,
                    and the portion of the structure below the isolation system;
